{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"耶利米书","commonName":"耶利米书","title":"耶利米书","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"16ded5dc4e2ddb729010e3886586b1a875952506b8d309b0047c2ac2b798eef4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1361},"chapter":{"number":30,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶和华给他子民的应许"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华的话临到耶利米说："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「耶和华—以色列的 神如此说：你将我对你说过的一切话都写在书上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["耶和华说：日子将到，我要使我的百姓以色列和犹大被掳的人归回；我也要使他们回到我所赐给他们列祖之地，他们就得这地为业。这是耶和华说的。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"以下是耶和华论到以色列和犹大所说的话：","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"耶和华如此说：我们听见声音，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是战抖惧怕而不平安的声音。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们且访问看看，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"男人有产难吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我怎么看见人人用手掐腰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像产难的妇人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"脸面都变青了呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"哀哉！那日为大，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无日可比；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是雅各遭难的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但他必被救出来。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["万军之耶和华说：「到那日，我必从你颈项上折断仇敌的轭，扭开他的绳索；外邦人不得再使你作他们的奴仆。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["你们却要事奉耶和华—你们的 神和我为你们所要兴起的王大卫。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"故此，耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的仆人雅各啊，不要惧怕；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列啊，不要惊惶；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因我要从远方拯救你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从被掳到之地拯救你的后裔；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各必回来得享平靖安逸，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无人使他害怕。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因我与你同在，要拯救你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也要将所赶散你到的那些国灭绝净尽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"却不将你灭绝净尽，倒要从宽惩治你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万不能不罚你","poem":1},{"noteId":30},{"text":"。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"耶和华如此说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的损伤无法医治；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的伤痕极其重大。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无人为你分诉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你的伤痕得以缠裹；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你没有医治的良药。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你所亲爱的都忘记你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不来探问","poem":1},{"noteId":31},{"text":"你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我因你的罪孽甚大，罪恶众多，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"曾用仇敌加的伤害伤害你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用残忍者的惩治惩治你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你为何因损伤哀号呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的痛苦无法医治。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我因你的罪孽甚大，罪恶众多，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"曾将这些加在你身上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"故此，凡吞吃你的必被吞吃；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的敌人个个都被掳去；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"掳掠你的必成为掳物；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"抢夺你的必成为掠物。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：我必使你痊愈，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"医好你的伤痕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都因人称你为被赶散的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"说：这是锡安，无人来探问","poem":1},{"noteId":32},{"text":"的！","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"耶和华如此说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使雅各被掳去的帐棚归回，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也必顾惜他的住处。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"城必建造在原旧的山冈；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"宫殿也照旧有人居住。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必有感谢和欢乐的声音从其中发出，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使他们增多，不致减少；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他们尊荣，不致卑微。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的儿女要如往日；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的会众坚立在我面前；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凡欺压他们的，我必刑罚他。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的君王必是属乎他们的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"掌权的必从他们中间而出。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使他就近我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他也要亲近我；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不然，谁有胆量亲近我呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要作我的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要作你们的 神。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"text":"看哪，耶和华的忿怒","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像暴风已经发出；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是扫灭的暴风，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必转到恶人的头上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华的烈怒必不转消，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"直到他心中所拟定的成就了；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"末后的日子你们要明白。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":30,"caller":"-","text":"不罚你：或译以你为无罪","reference":{"chapter":30,"verse":11}},{"noteId":31,"caller":"-","text":"或译：理会","reference":{"chapter":30,"verse":14}},{"noteId":32,"caller":"-","text":"或译：理会","reference":{"chapter":30,"verse":17}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/30.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/31.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/29.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":24}